"disponibile, dar numai pe formularul fiecărei categorii de produse."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/inventory_valuation/inventory_valuation_config.rst:98
msgid ""
"Refer to the :ref:`Expense <inventory/warehouses_storage/expense-account>` "
