#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/inventory_valuation/inventory_valuation_config.rst:107
msgid ""
"After :ref:`enabling inventory valuation <inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"accounting-setup>`, the next step is to set the product category to use "
"automatic inventory valuation."
msgstr ""
"După :ref:`activarea evaluării inventarului <inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"accounting-setup>`, următorul pas este să setați categoria de produse pentru "
"a utiliza evaluarea automată a stocurilor."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/inventory_valuation/inventory_valuation_config.rst:110
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Product "
"Categories`, and select the desired product category. In "
"the :guilabel:`Inventory Valuation` section, set the :guilabel:`Inventory "
"Valuation` field to :guilabel:`Automated`. Repeat this step for every "
"product category intending to use automatic inventory valuation."
msgstr ""
"Accesați :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Product "
