"ia în considerare următoarele scenarii:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:59
msgid ""
":ref:`Purchase and sell products <inventory/product_management/valuation-"
"cost-example>`: cost is calculated based on the *product category's* costing "
"method."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Cumpără și vinde produse <inventory/product_management/valuation-cost-"
"example>`: costul este calculat pe baza metodei de calcul a costului din "
"*categoria de produs*."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:61
msgid ""
":ref:`Create new lot/serial numbers <inventory/product_management/valuation-"
"cost-new>` using an inventory adjustment: value of the new lot/serial number "
"is assigned to the cost from the product form."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Creează loturi/numere de serie noi <inventory/product_management/"
"valuation-cost-new>` folosind o ajustare de inventar: valoarea noului lot/"
"număr de serie este atribuită costului din formularul produsului."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:64
msgid ""
"Inventory adjustment to update quantities for an :ref:`existing lot/serial "
"number <inventory/product_management/valuation-cost-existing>`: value is "
"assigned based on the most recent cost for that lot/serial number."
msgstr ""
"Ajustare de inventar pentru actualizarea cantităților unui :ref:`lot/număr "
"de serie existent <inventory/product_management/valuation-cost-existing>`: "
"valoarea este atribuită pe baza celui mai recent cost pentru acel lot/număr "
"de serie."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:68
