#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/cad_bom_import/drawings.rst:181
msgid "Designations are normalised before they are looked up: upper case, no accents, ``×`` and ``*`` as ``x``, decimal comma as point, and a trailing grade (``S235JR``, ``OL 37``) is split off. A count prefix such as ``2xL50x5`` is kept as a count."
