"câmpul :guilabel:`Cantitate` pentru a se potrivi cu cantitatea comandată din "
"câmpul :guilabel:`Cerere`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step.rst:149
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps.rst:249
