"Odată gata, faceți clic pe :guilabel:`Validate`. Odată validată, comanda de "
"livrare trece în stadiul :guilabel:`Terminat`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step.rst:158
msgid ""
"Click back to the |SO| (via the breadcrumbs, at the top of the form) to view "
"the |SO| form. On the product line, the quantity in "
"the :guilabel:`Delivered` column now matches the "
