msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Foxpost Configuration` tab, fill in the three credentials "
"from the :ref:`account setup <inventory/shipping_receiving/foxpost-account>`:"
msgstr ""
"În fila :guilabel:`Configurare Foxpost`, completați cele trei date de "
"autentificare din :ref:`configurarea contului <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"foxpost-account>`:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`API User` and :guilabel:`API Password`: the HTTP authentication "
"pair for the Foxpost web API."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Utilizator API` și :guilabel:`Parolă API`: perechea de "
"autentificare HTTP pentru API-ul web Foxpost."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`API Key`: the additional key Foxpost requires on every API call."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cheie API`: cheia suplimentară pe care Foxpost o cere la fiecare "
"apel API."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:86
msgid ""
"These fields — together with the :guilabel:`Delivery type` field described "
"below — are only visible to users in the *Administration / Settings* group; "
"other users see the shipping method form without them."
msgstr ""
"Aceste câmpuri — împreună cu câmpul :guilabel:`Tip de livrare` descris mai "
"jos — sunt vizibile numai utilizatorilor din grupul *Administration / "
"Settings*; ceilalți utilizatori văd formularul metodei de expediere fără ele."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:90
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Environment` smart button in the top-right corner of the form "
"toggles between :guilabel:`Test Environment` and :guilabel:`Production "
"Environment`. In test mode, every call goes to Foxpost's test API; switch "
"the method to production once the flow has been verified end to end."
msgstr ""
"Butonul inteligent :guilabel:`Mediu` din colțul din dreapta sus al "
"formularului comută între :guilabel:`Test Environment` "
"și :guilabel:`Production Environment`. În modul de test, fiecare apel merge "
"către API-ul de test Foxpost; treceți metoda în producție după ce fluxul a "
"fost verificat de la un capăt la altul."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost.rst:95
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/gls.rst:87
