"tab selects one of two operating modes. A single shipping method always "
"works in exactly one mode; to offer both, publish two methods (which is what "
"the two preinstalled records provide)."
msgstr ""
"Câmpul :guilabel:`Tip de livrare` din fila :guilabel:`Configurare Foxpost` "
