#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Do`: show stock move records that are in progress. This "
"includes lines with a :guilabel:`Status` column value "
"of :guilabel:`Available` or :guilabel:`Partially Available`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`De făcut`: arată înregistrările de mutare a stocurilor care sunt "
