#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Done`: completed stock moves, with a :guilabel:`Status` "
"of :guilabel:`Done`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Terminat`: mutari de stoc finalizate, cu un :guilabel:`Stare` "
