"Configuration --> Products: Product Categories`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:102
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Batch Transfer`: group records by :doc:`batch <../../"
